WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Small subcontractors spend hours searching different websites for public construction bids,

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
and many of the bids they find don't even match their trade.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.500
BidSort puts North Carolina public bids in one place.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Pick your trade and area, and it filters out the rest,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.500
so you only see bids that match your work.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Then it sends you an alert when a new bid matches, so you never miss one.
